{"b":"Ps","c":66,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Make a joyful noise unto God, all ye lands:","x":[["1Chr.16.23",14,"r"],["1Chr.16.24",14,"r"],["Ps.100.1",11,"e"],["Ps.98.4",8,"w"],["Ps.81.1",6,"e"],["Ps.150.6",6,"r"],["1Chr.15.28",3,"w"],["Ps.117.1",3,"r"],["Ps.117.2",3,"r"],["Ps.96.1",3,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Sing forth the honour of his name: make his praise glorious.","x":[["Ps.105.2",10,"w"],["Ps.105.3",10,"r"],["Rev.5.13",7,"w"],["Isa.49.13",7,"w"],["Isa.42.12",6,"w"],["Isa.12.4",5,"w"],["Isa.12.6",5,"r"],["Neh.9.5",5,"w"],["Rev.4.8",5,"r"],["Rev.4.11",5,"w"]]},{"n":3,"t":"Say unto God, How terrible art thou in thy works! through the greatness of thy power shall thine enemies submit themselves unto thee.","it":[[27,38]],"x":[["Ps.18.44",10,"w"],["Ps.65.5",9,"w"],["Ps.81.15",6,"w"],["Ps.47.2",5,"w"],["Isa.2.19",3,"r"],["Ps.22.28",3,"r"],["Ps.22.29",3,"r"],["Ps.78.35",3,"r"],["Ps.78.36",3,"r"],["Jer.10.10",3,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"All the earth shall worship thee, and shall sing unto thee; they shall sing to thy name. Selah.","it":[[76,78]],"x":[["Ps.22.27",8,"w"],["Ps.96.1",5,"w"],["Ps.96.2",5,"w"],["Ps.117.1",5,"r"],["Rev.15.4",4,"w"],["Dan.7.14",4,"r"],["Mal.1.11",4,"r"],["Isa.42.10",3,"w"],["Isa.42.12",3,"r"],["Isa.11.9",2,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"Come and see the works of God: he is terrible in his doing toward the children of men.","it":[[31,36],[46,52]],"x":[["Ps.126.1",6,"r"],["Ps.126.3",6,"r"],["Num.23.23",4,"r"],["Ps.46.8",3,"w"],["Ps.66.16",3,"r"],["Ps.111.2",3,"w"],["Ps.66.3",3,"w"],["Ps.99.3",2,"w"],["Ps.106.22",2,"w"],["Ezek.1.18",1,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"He turned the sea into dry land: they went through the flood on foot: there did we rejoice in him.","it":[[27,32]],"x":[["Josh.3.16",5,"w"],["Exod.14.21",4,"w"],["Exod.14.22",4,"w"],["Exod.15.1",4,"w"],["Exod.15.21",4,"w"],["Josh.3.14",4,"r"],["Ps.78.13",4,"w"],["Ps.136.13",3,"w"],["Ps.136.14",3,"r"],["Ps.106.8",3,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"He ruleth by his power for ever; his eyes behold the nations: let not the rebellious exalt themsel